&lt;li&gt;Prior sales experience in the software industry, especially within the CPM/EPM industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Accounting, Finance and Corporate Performance Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of building rapport with C-level executives and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savvy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand and react to customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel.&lt;/li&gt;
